Hi Groovers! If there is one newsletter you should read this year, then this is it. This happens to be our most exciting newsletter that we have released. Ever.  In the past we have announced new classes, international artists, a festival, full day workshops, drum, drum and more drums..... but this time, we are announcing the biggest and best yet and for those of you that don't know about what is happening in July, this is your opportunity to get loaded with the info and still have time to grab your early bird rate which ends in one week! We are about to have the best time ever and we want you to be a part of it. [Camp Afro Foli](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) Drum & Dance Retreat July 14th - 16th will be knocking on all drummers, dancers, and people that just generally love to have a good time doors this month. It's time to circle that weekend in your diary and pack your bags because Rhythm Culture is bringing this event for the very first time to the lush hinterland of the Sunshine Coast. We have international and interstate artists (one of each), Brisbane's best , bush, accommodation, camp fires, workshops, performances, African feasts and picnic lunches all over a 3 day retreat. Bring your hands, feet, and vocal cords at the very least and be prepared to have an unforgettable weekend. So read on for more information and of course NEW June class information, couple of exciting new videos, specials and deals new to Rhythm Culture. See you all with tights or drums, or drums and tights on at Camp Afro Foli!
